  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "a8228b29",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# 循环\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "57909e38",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**Julia**提供了两种用于执行重复计算的结构：`for`循环和`while`循环。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0173c8c3",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "##  `for`循环\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c1ec3330",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "`for`循环具有以下结构：\n\n```julia\nfor i = m:n\n    actions\nend\n```\n\n其中，`i`是一个计数器变量，其取值范围由等号右侧指定的数值范围决定；`m:n`是一个范围对象，表示从`m`到`n`、步长为$1$的序列。`for`循环会遍历这些值，并将它们逐一赋值给变量`i`。\n\n示例。使用`for`循环，将$1$到$10$之间的所有自然数输出到屏幕上。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9cdb5552",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "for i = 1:10\r\n    println(i)\r\nend    "
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "520c069c",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务1\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d46a3061",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "使用`for`循环，计算$1$到$100$之间所有自然数的和。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "13b37379",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        ""
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "aedee56e",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">提示</span>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 3,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0aab17df",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "在开始循环之前，将求和变量 `s` 的初始值设置为0。然后围绕变量`i`开始循环，该循环将遍历从$1$到$100$的所有自然数。在循环体内，编写用于计算求和值的表达式：`s = s + i`。循环结束后，使用`println`函数将求和值显示在显示屏上。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "410186e4",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "##### <span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 1,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ae2d3f93",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "s = 0\r\nfor i = 1:100\r\n    s = s + i\r\nend\r\nprintln(s)"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4b2e5f8a",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "###\n\n在`for`循环体内部，无论外层范围中是否存在同名变量，都会引入一个新的计数器变量。因此，一方面，变量`i`无需在循环前进行声明；另一方面，该变量在循环外不可访问，也不会影响外层同名变量。\n\n在一个针对某个变量的循环内部，可能还包含一个针对另一个变量的第二个循环。这种循环被称为**嵌套循环**。嵌套循环是处理二维数组（矩阵）元素操作的一种便捷方式。允许任意数量的嵌套循环。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "493ba53d",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务2\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "43cb0ac7",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "定义一个矩阵 \r\n\r\n$$A=\\begin{pmatrix} 2 & 8 & -3 \\\\ -4 & 9 & 8 \\\\ 6 & -5 & 1 \\end{pmatrix}.$$\r\n\r\n使用针对索引`i`和`j`的双重循环，计算该矩阵中所有元素的乘积。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4a505448",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        ""
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "33f84c1e",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">提示</span>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 3,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "01b3fda4",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "在开始循环之前，将乘积 `P` 的初始值设置为1。第一个针对变量`i`的循环将遍历矩阵的行索引（来自$1$到$3$），而第二个针对变量`j`的循环将遍历列索引（同样来自$1$到$3$）。在循环内部，编写计算乘积的表达式：`P = P * A[i,j]`。循环结束后，使用`println`函数将`P`的值显示在显示屏上。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ef843615",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "##### <span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 1,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "baeb134f",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "A = [2 8 -3; -4 9 8; 6 -5 1]\r\nP = 1\r\nfor i = 1:3\r\n    for j = 1:3\r\n        P = P * A[i,j]\r\n    end\r\nend\r\nprintln(P)"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d16c569d",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "###\r\n\r\n一般，`for`循环*可以遍历任何容器*。在这种情况下，关键字`in`或`∈`可作为`=`符号的等效替代，这使得代码更加清晰：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "40d325f7",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "for i in [1, 4, 7, 2, 0]\r\n    println(i)\r\nend   "
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9a6a876b",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "for s ∈ [\"red\", \"green\", \"blue\"]\r\n    println(s)\r\nend"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "493e2951",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "多个嵌套的`for`循环可以合并为一个外层循环，从而得到被迭代对象的笛卡尔积：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1c00b83",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "for i = 1:3, j = 4:6\r\n    println((i, j))\r\nend"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5814342f",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "使用此语法时，仍可在迭代对象内部引用外层循环的变量。例如，表达式`for i = 1:n, j = 1:i`是有效的。 \n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "922b98c8",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "##  `while`循环\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "41af0ef7",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "`while`循环具有以下结构：\n\n```julia\nwhile condition\n    actions\nend\n```\n\n这里，`condition`是一个逻辑表达式。只要其求值为`true`，`while`循环体内的操作就会被反复执行。一旦`condition`变为`false`，循环即告结束。如果循环的首次迭代中`condition`为`false`，则`while`循环体内的操作将完全不会被执行。\n\n示例。使用`while`循环，让我们在显示屏上显示从$1$到$10$之间的所有自然数。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "77a13789",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "i = 1\r\nwhile i <= 10\r\n    println(i)\r\n    i = i + 1\r\nend    "
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e18ad352",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "在`while`循环中，变量`i`的值必须发生变化，使得在某个迭代中，循环条件`i <= 10`评估结果为`false`。否则，循环将无限期运行。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c5c0b0c0",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务3\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
