    {
      "id": "e068abd8",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "使用`while`循环，计算从$25$到$75$的所有自然数的和。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
