            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ced550e7",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">提示</span>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 3,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1e896860",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "在开始循环之前，将索引 `i` 的初始值设置为$25$，并将和 `s` 的初始值设置为0。然后打开`while`循环。由于需要遍历所有`i`的自然数，范围来自$25$到$75$，因此循环必须持续进行，直到`i`超过$75$。换言之，循环条件可表示为：`i <= 75`。在循环体内，编写表达式计算求和结果`s = s + i`，然后将索引`i`递增1。循环结束后，使用`println`函数将求和结果显示在显示屏上。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "17f0b7c7",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "##### <span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解决方案</span>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 1,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0a84bdc9",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "i = 25\r\ns = 0\r\nwhile i <= 75\r\n    s = s + i\r\n    i = i + 1\r\nend\r\nprintln(s)"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4b6d1f5a",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "##  `break`关键字\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a8e7b183",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "有时需要在条件评估为`false`之前终止`while`循环，或者在迭代对象结束之前终止`for`循环。为此，可以使用`break`关键字，它会将控制权转移到循环体后面的第一个语句。\n\n示例。以下代码打印来自$1$到$10$的所有自然数的和。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "936fcc10",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "i = 0\r\ns = 0\r\nwhile true\r\n    i = i + 1\r\n    s = s + i\r\n    if i >= 10\r\n        break\r\n    end\r\nend\r\nprintln(s)"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "73b0290a",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "一旦计数器`i`达到值$10$，循环将通过`break`关键字终止。\n\n如果没有`break`关键字，上述`while`循环的执行将永远不会自行终止，因为循环头中的条件始终为`true`。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "338e0a8a",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务4\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c0481d7f",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "编写一个函数`ifzero`，该函数以一维数值数组`x`为输入，并使用`for`循环检查该数组是否至少包含一个0元素。该函数必须返回文本“该数组包含零元素”或“该数组不包含零元素”。然后调用函数`ifzero`，并传入输入数组`[1 2 0 4]`和`[3 7 8 5]`。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "248a6556",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        ""
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "94b7c96e",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">提示</span>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 5,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "da9b02ee",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "首先，在函数`ifzero(x)`的主体中，将字符串变量 `s` 设置为`\"The array contains no zero elements\"`。然后针对索引`i`开启一个`for`循环，该循环从`1`开始，一直运行到数组`x`的元素数量（可通过函数`length(x)`获取）。在循环体中，检查条件：如果数组`x`的第`i`个元素等于0，则执行由两个操作组成的代码块。首先，将变量`s`的值改为`\"The array contains a zero element\"`。由于已在数组`x`中找到一个为0的元素，因此无需再检查剩余元素。因此，`if`代码块中的第二个操作将是使用`break`关键字提前退出循环。循环结束后，将变量 `s` 设置为函数（`return s`）的返回值。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0c5f9ec8",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "##### <span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解决方案</span>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 3,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4a0df078",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "function ifzero(x)\r\n    s = \"The array contains no zero elements\"\r\n    for i = 1:length(x)\r\n        if x[i] == 0 \r\n            s = \"The array contains a zero element\"\r\n            break\r\n        end   \r\n    end\r\n    return s\r\nend"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6dbd3533",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "ifzero([1 2 0 4])"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3a60d118",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "ifzero([3 7 8 5])"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "54ea7cb6",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "##  `continue`关键字\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6f067c3f",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "在其他情况下，中断当前迭代并直接跳转到下一次迭代可能会很有用。`continue`关键字正是为此目的而设计的。\n\n示例。以下代码打印所有是$7$的倍数且属于区间$[1,100]$的数字。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cf5125dc",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "for i = 1:100\r\n    if mod(i,7) != 0\r\n        continue\r\n    else\r\n        println(i)\r\n    end\r\nend"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8028d42d",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "在循环体内，会进行条件判断：如果变量`i`不是$7$的倍数（即`i`除以$7$的余数不为0），则跳转到循环的下一轮；否则，将`i`的值输出到屏幕上。\n\n该问题无需使用`continue`即可解决，方法是反转条件，并将`println`调用置于`if`代码块内：\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a0f10c96",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "for i = 1:100\r\n    if mod(i,7) == 0\r\n        println(i)\r\n    end\r\nend"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "13fe7356",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "实际上，`continue`关键字之后通常会跟有更复杂的计算，且通常会有多个调用`continue`的点。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "84d5d61e",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务5\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6e909e0c",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "使用`for`循环，计算一维数组`x = [4 5 0 10 2 0 8 0 1 16]`中所有非零元素的倒数。为防止除以0，请使用`continue`关键字。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "536571a4",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        ""
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6623a706",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">提示</span>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 5,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "feb37d9f",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "首先，针对索引`i`建立一个`for`循环，该循环从$1$开始迭代，直至数组`x`中的元素数量（可通过`length(x)`函数获取）。在循环体中，检查条件：如果数组`x`的第`i`个元素等于0，则无需计算该元素的倒数，因此应使用`continue`关键字进入循环的下一个迭代。在循环体内，位于`if`代码块之后，计算数组`x`中第`i`个元素的倒数，并将其打印到屏幕上：`println(1/x[i])`。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4ab5e305",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "##### <span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 3,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "46c61dc7",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "x = [4 5 0 10 2 0 8 0 1 16]\r\nfor i = 1:length(x)\r\n    if x[i] == 0\r\n        continue\r\n    end\r\n    println(1/x[i])    \r\nend"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1220c260",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "{% note info \"注\" %}\n\n该问题也可以不使用`continue`来解决，方法是反转条件，并将倒数的计算置于`if`块内：\n\n{% endnote %}\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "23baf7ee",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "x = [4 5 0 10 2 0 8 0 1 16]\r\nfor i = 1:length(x)\r\n    if x[i] != 0\r\n        println(1/x[i])\r\n    end\r\nend"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
